  "id": "thick-stripes",
  "term": "thick stripes",
  "definition": "In this visual testing context, thick stripes are the wider moving stripe patterns shown to medaka larvae in an optomotor-response assay. Initial exposure to these wider stripes was associated with improved later responses to narrower stripes.",
