      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define “thick stripes” as “wider moving stripe patterns.” It only mentions a “training effect” from “initial exposure of larvae to thick stripes” and that the OMR presents adjustable stripes (with adjustable width), but it does not directly equate thick stripes with “wider” patterns in the definition.",
        "The definition’s “improved later responses to narrower stripes” is supported by the packet (“allowed them to better respond to narrower stripes”), but the first part of the requested sense (“wider moving stripe patterns”) is not explicitly supported."
